  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall coordination and management of the partnership on the Arabic L</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the aim to enhance multilinguism, and address the many-faceted relations between Arabic and the system of knowledge acquisition, a set of activities will be implemented within the Framework of this partnership. This work plan intends to ensure coordination and reinforce intersectoral cooperation to enhance delivery and impact of the Organization&apos;s work. It will also enhance communication for dissemination and outreach of the results achieved. Adequate support to evaluation and reporting will also be provided, in line with the Organization&apos;s reporting Framework..</narrative>
